;; CommonTree and Pine. Organic scatter around the cottages.
;; ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

;; Individual trees removed — replaced by GDScript MultiMesh far treeline:
;; 22 Pine_3 instances at r=19-28 m, plus grass/flower/clover scatter rings.
;; See VillageBackdrop._setup_multimesh_scatter().
